ition it cannot be God, because God doesn't change!",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Christian Claims The Quran Contains Satanic Verses?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=27xa01f05ag", ((1971, "32:51–34:00"), (2045, "34:05–34:39"), (2112, "35:12–35:33"),), id: 3858)
