ike the human beings count 1 plus 1, or 1 2 3 4, whatever, there's no way you can understand the concept of the trinity, at the same time you say they're one. That's why you have the idea of mystery. Everyone says it's a mystery. So if these church fathers, they themselves call it a mystery, you're not going to get someone who studied this or studied that explain it to us. The true reason people can't explain it, because it's not from God. It's philosophy, and it's philosophy that doesn't make sense.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Passionate Christian Argues For The Trinity With A Muslim! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ntsF1iRj8IM", ((896, "14:56–15:36"), (942, "15:42–16:03"), (989, "16:29–17:16"), (1050, "17:30–18:08"),), id: 3864)
