#passage(("We're saying there's only one Jesus, the one described in the Quran, and we're seeing even the book that you're reading, it does not support the Jesus that you're serving. I'm saying the Bible does not support the idea of Jesus that you are following, that he's a part of God or he has attributes of God. It does not support any of that. Rather it supports the Islamic perception of Jesus; which means that what you believe is what the Church taught you, whatever people around you taught you, has nothing to do with who Jesus really was.", "Allah quotes Jesus speaking in the Quran. For example Allah said (Quran5:72) لَّقَدْ كَفَرَ الَّذِينَ قَالُوا إِنَّ اللَّهَ هُوَ الْمَسِيحُ ابْنُ مَرْيَمَ (Those who say that Jesus the Messiah is God has disbelieved) وَقَالَ الْمَسِيحُ يَا بَنِي إِسْرَائِيلَ اعْبُدُوا اللَّهَ رَبِّي وَرَبَّكُمْ (and Jesus said O children of Israel worship Allah your Lord and my Lord). Remember the verse I showed you: \"I’m going to my Lord and your Lord\". إِنَّهُ مَن يُشْرِكْ بِاللَّهِ فَقَدْ حَرَّمَ اللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ الْجَنَّةَ (whoever associates with Allah, Allah have made Paradise impermissible for him). He's not going to enter Paradise.", "That's why you see always God in the Old Testament, if you are reading: I'm a jealous God, do not take any image other than me, do not worship any other than me, do not take idols (Exodus20:4-6). Why? Because if you've given the attributes, the worship, the gratitude of the Most-High to anyone else, of course you don't deserve to go to paradise. I have to tell you the Truth: anyone who does that, if I worship Prophet Muhammadﷺ or I worship Jesus or Moses or Noah or my father or a picture or a cow, like some people do, whatever you worship other than God, you don't deserve to enter Paradise, if you die in that state.",), "The Muslim Lantern, “Does Jesus Possess The Attributes of God?! Muhammed Ali”", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Jp6DQffnZg", ((1414, "23:34–23:50"), (1439, "23:59–24:35"), (1478, "